NOTE ON DATA

The MIT license above covers the CODE in this repository (build scripts,
stylesheets, front-end JavaScript, workflows).

The DERIVED DATA in data/ (structured facts, relations and parameters
extracted from a copyrighted textbook) is released under
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

The underlying textbook — 《口腔修复学》第 8 版, 赵铱民主编, 人民卫生出版社 —
remains the copyright of its authors and publisher. This project reproduces no
prose, figures or images from it; it extracts only factual statements
(indications, steps, measurements) reorganised into a queryable structure for
study purposes. It is an unofficial study aid with no affiliation to the
publisher or authors.
